== diags.diag/unique-implicit-copy
BYN2780 6:13 implicit copy of a unique value: `List<i64>` is unique: it owns its storage
  help hand the value over with `move a`; make an independent copy with `a.copy(to: alloc)`; pass it by `ref` to share it instead
  fix 6:13-6:13 move 
BYN2780 8:13 implicit copy of a unique value: `Map<string, i64>` is unique: it owns its storage
  help hand the value over with `move m`; make an independent copy with `m.copy(to: alloc)`; pass it by `ref` to share it instead
  fix 8:13-8:13 move 
BYN2780 11:17 implicit copy of a unique value: `StrBuf` is unique: it owns its storage
  help hand the value over with `move sb`; make an independent copy with `sb.copy(to: alloc)`; pass it by `ref` to share it instead
  fix 11:17-11:17 move 
